xbx-nrf licensing
=================

Copyright (c) 2026 zuidec

This project uses different licenses for different kinds of content. The full
license texts are in LICENSES/. Per-path details are in REUSE.toml
(https://reuse.software).

  Firmware, configurator and scripts (firmware/, tools/,    MPL-2.0
  build scripts, config)
  Hardware design (pcb/, mech/)                             CERN-OHL-S-2.0
  Documentation (docs/, *.md)                               CC-BY-4.0

Exceptions (third-party CAD parts; see ATTRIBUTION.md in each folder):

  pcb/xbx-nrf/lib/RKJXV122400R/,       SnapMagic CAD files, CC-BY-SA-4.0
  pcb/xbx-nrf/lib/USB_C_*/,            with the SnapMagic Design Exception
  pcb/xbx-nrf-dongle/lib/USB_C_*/,     1.0.
  pcb/xbx-nrf-dongle/lib/JS102011SAQN/

  mech/aux-button-guide/               Remix of Tryhard Customs' rear button
                                       guides: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 (no commercial
                                       use; remixes under the same license).

  pcb/xbx-nrf/lib/xbx-nrf-lib.pretty/, Footprints copied from KiCad's
  pcb/xbx-nrf-dongle/lib/              libraries: CC-BY-SA-4.0 WITH
    xbx-nrf-lib.pretty/                KiCad-libraries-exception. The USB-C
                                       footprints there are SnapMagic's
                                       (above); the controller's membrane
                                       contact is ours (CERN-OHL-S-2.0).

  pcb/xbx-nrf/lib/xbx-nrf.kicad_sym    Symbols from KiCad's libraries
                                       (CC-BY-SA-4.0 WITH
                                       KiCad-libraries-exception), from
                                       SnapMagic and our own (CC-BY-SA-4.0).

Release binaries (.uf2 firmware, the configurator) also contain third-party
code; its notices come with each release (THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES).

Not included: references/third-party/ (git-ignored) holds third-party documents
that are not part of this project and not covered by its licenses; see
references/README.md for their sources.
